  5
169
330
17
100
AcDbEntity
  8
NOTES
100
AcDbText
 10
0.0
 20
-22.0
 30
0.0
 40
2.5
  1
Magnet position on the sign: bar centreline, centred on the saddle 11 mm in front of the body rim (8 mm in front of the lid's outer face), flat face parallel to the saddle floor, either pole, 1.0 mm running clearance.
 11
0.0
 21
-22.0
 31
0.0
