NOTES
100
AcDbText
 10
0.0
 20
-26.0
 30
0.0
 40
2.5
  1
Bar 88 wide: no maker publishes a hand-hole size; scaled from the makers' own photos the narrowest common hole is about 105 (Rubbermaid FG6112xx). Seat 42 for a folded sign up to 38 thick (Rubbermaid's published closed depth). Bar 46 below the body, reach 86 from the wall face, no gussets at the lip root.
